<h2>India vs Ecuador: comparing shrimp origins for Chinese buyers</h2>
<p>Ecuador is India's main direct competitor for the Chinese vannamei shrimp market, and Chinese buyers frequently source from both origins. Neither is uniformly cheaper or better — the right choice depends on what you're optimizing for.</p>
